WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Connected to eduroam-lab.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The connection drops (e.g. due to jamming): an impostor takes over

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
User is asked to accept the new certificate

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.700
User taps "Accept" and their plaintext credentials are sent to the attacker
